{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-06_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-06","title":"少见多怪","storyCode":"4-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0eada578e445d597365d6641613e8f544d19e524778b32578dd44b1ffcb48fa7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"罗德岛一行来到分城废墟，城里的状况令人在意。\n交谈中，有什么人引起了陈的注意，她独自追去，一行想要跟上却被整合运动阻拦。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是个阴沉的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"外交频道呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"没消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，这里已经被乌萨斯抛弃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"废城......吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它已经成了整合运动的窝点，对于龙门而言，情况会变得越来越难以处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"离龙门太近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果碎骨的行动是接受了这里的指挥，那我们放任不管的后果，确实不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，切尔诺伯格的这个分城——究竟发生了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"遭受天灾之后是不可能移动这么长的距离的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，它会出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"从观测得来的数据分析......这里遭受过天灾的余波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"分城是在移动到这里后才被天灾摧毁的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。看来，罗德岛还有些很不错的天灾信使嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"谨慎是正确的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上都有散漫的整合运动埋伏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"简直像是食腐野兽一样盘踞在这废城之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"真的令人有点不太舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我确认了坐标，我们罗德岛还得继续深入——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但这个地形，我认为，不适合整个部队一同行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来就是源石多生地带了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然是你。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，你觉得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，你去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，跑得真快！那个难道是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也没有看清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我觉得那个身影确实是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得追上去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"居然选择在这个时候拦住我们......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那个家伙，不是一般的整合运动成员——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......从哪爬出来这么多源石生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那些源石生物......可能会爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"让罗德岛的伙计们，都小心点！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊","陈"]}]}
